      "text": "Day 2 · A city and Canal tour: the Miraflores Locks Visitor Center, where you can watch ships being raised or lowered through the canal, with a museum on its history from the first French construction efforts to its expansion, inaugurated in 2016; the Biomuseo, the biodiversity museum; lunch and a historical walking tour of Casco Viejo, with its restored colonial houses, cathedral and plazas. Overnight in Panama City. (B)",
